<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Magnitude of a vector and distance between points</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Give exact values, or decimals correct to 2 decimal places.</p><p>(a) Find the magnitude of \({@cv3(v)@}\).</p><div>[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</div><p>(b) Find the distance between \(P({@P[1]@},\,{@P[2]@},\,{@P[3]@})\) and \(Q({@Q[1]@},\,{@Q[2]@},\,{@Q[3]@})\).</p><div>[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</div>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Pythagoras twice: across the floor, then up, gives \(|\mathbf{r}| = \sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2}\).</p><p>(a) \(\sqrt{({@v[1]@})^2 + ({@v[2]@})^2 + ({@v[3]@})^2} = \sqrt{{@S@}} = {@tm1@}\)[[if test="not integerp(tm1)"]] \(\approx {@m1d@}\)[[/if]].</p><p>(b) \(\overrightarrow{PQ} = \mathbf{q} - \mathbf{p} = {@cv3(d)@}\), so \(PQ = \sqrt{({@d[1]@})^2 + ({@d[2]@})^2 + ({@d[3]@})^2} = \sqrt{{@Sd@}} = {@tm2@}\)[[if test="not integerp(tm2)"]] \(\approx {@m2d@}\)[[/if]].</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[cv3(v) := matrix([v[1]],[v[2]],[v[3]]);
/* Design: magnitude of a vector and distance between points. Entries 1 to 4 have whole-number magnitudes. Diagnostics are more than 2 x 0.00501 apart on every entry. Source: adapted from SMP AS/A2 Core 4, Chapter 9, C9 and Exercise D, Q6. */
mlist: [[[-6,-2,9],[2,-5,-3],[1,6,2]],[[-4,8,-1],[6,4,-4],[-1,-3,-5]],[[-2,6,-3],[-1,2,-1],[5,3,-5]],[[-2,10,-11],[5,-3,-1],[-2,2,-2]],[[4,8,-7],[-5,6,4],[2,1,-5]],[[-5,7,1],[-5,5,3],[5,3,2]],[[5,-3,7],[1,1,2],[-2,-3,-5]],[[2,-1,4],[-4,1,-2],[5,5,-3]],[[7,-4,1],[1,1,4],[-2,5,5]],[[-1,8,-7],[-3,-1,6],[-1,3,-5]]];
ix: 1+rand(10);
v: mlist[ix][1]; P: mlist[ix][2]; Q: mlist[ix][3];
sq3(u) := u[1]^2+u[2]^2+u[3]^2;
S: sq3(v); tm1: sqrt(S);
d: Q-P; Sd: sq3(d); tm2: sqrt(Sd);
neg: first(sublist(v, lambda([t], is(t < 0))));
dg2: sqrt(abs(v[1]*abs(v[1])+v[2]*abs(v[2])+v[3]*abs(v[3])));
dg3: abs(v[1])+abs(v[2])+abs(v[3]);
dg4: abs(v[1]+v[2]+v[3]);
eP: sqrt(sq3(P+Q)); eQ: sqrt(sq3(Q)); eA: abs(d[1])+abs(d[2])+abs(d[3]);
m1d: dispdp(float(floor(10^2*(tm1)+1/2)/10^2),2); m2d: dispdp(float(floor(10^2*(tm2)+1/2)/10^2),2);
f1: float(tm1); f2: float(tm2);
r1: float(floor(100*tm1+1/2)/100); r2: float(floor(100*tm2+1/2)/100);
w1: f1+0.5; w2: f2+0.5;
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
