  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Vectors II: magnitude of a vector and distance between points</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 2.6: Find the magnitude of a three-dimensional vector and the distance between two points, exactly or to 2 decimal places.</p><p id="edition">Core</p><p id="provenance">This question is adapted from Question C9 in Section C and Question 6 in Exercise D of Chapter 9 of Instone, S., Ling, J., Scruton, P., Shilton, S. and West, H., SMP AS/A2 Mathematics: Core 4 for AQA, Cambridge University Press, 2005: new numbers, the two skills in one question, randomised over a curated list, with named feedback.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
